  owner = steward
  outcome = "After Cole's history ruling, meta.goal, DESIGN.md section 1, move-to-community and community-moved.sh are revised to that ruling (history ancestry checks for preserve; source-pointer commit and private-history exclusion checks for fresh import) and re-reviewed."
